      scope = "Accepted text: “VM run profiles MUST constrain modes, artifact/path reference classes, integer topology and exploration budgets, coverage mode, and raw-log policy before export.”\nImplementation: `contracts/evidence/run-config.ncl:1-89`, `RunProfileShape` and `Coherent`, constrain those exact fields, including absolute/relative artifact classes through shared primitives, closed modes/log enums, positive budgets and bitmap/blind coherence. Rust independently revalidates in `profile/run.rs:205-266`, `RunProfile::validate`.\nTests: `evidence_contracts.rs:378-386`, `run_nickel_examples`, executes rejecting unknown-mode/unknown-field/zero-budget/unsafe-reference/implicit-blind-coverage fixtures; inspected `contracts/evidence/fixtures/invalid/run-profile.unsafe-reference.invalid.ncl:1-9` really injects `../escape/vmlinux`. `profile/tests.rs:42`, `run_profile_rejects_unknown_fields_and_conflicting_coverage`, tests the external Rust boundary.\nLimit: pre-export/preconstruction shape only; no artifact-byte or guest-behavior claim.",
