      scope = "Accepted text: “In-process simulator profiles MUST validate workload identity, scheduler, virtual clock, RNG, simulated network and disk profiles, schedule reference, artifact bindings, seed, and required scope non-claims against the supported Rust DTO boundary.”\nImplementation: `contracts/evidence/simulator-profile.ncl:1-62`, `Shape`/`Coherent`, fixes round-robin/xorshift policies, positive clock/step values, simulated I/O, SHA-256 interoperability references, nonempty unique artifacts and exact scope. `simulator_profile.rs:43-109`, conversion/shape validation, calls `in_process_simulator.rs:896-977`, `validate_simulator_config`, which independently checks scheduler, RNG, virtual clock and simulated I/O.\nTests: `evidence_contracts.rs:387-390`, `run_nickel_examples`, rejects unsupported RNG, empty artifacts, malformed digest and weakened scope; inspected unsupported-RNG fixture changes algorithm to `host-random`. `simulator_profile.rs:163`, `duplicate_artifact_and_unknown_field_fail_closed` rejects duplicate artifacts and extra external fields.\nLimit: supported in-process DTO admission only, not simulator execution or VM replay.",
      accepted_sources = [".cairn/specs/simulator-campaign-profiles/spec.md"],
