      tests = ["tools/check-license-boundary.rs::run_self_tests"],
      scope = "Accepted text: “Repository-owned source templates and generated copies MUST carry visible `AGPL-3.0-or-later` terms. Generation guidance MUST describe those terms before distribution.”\nMapping: `docs/templates/rust-workload/src/main.rs:1` and `src/service.rs` have SPDX notices; template manifest/README/LICENSE are policy-required in `license-policy.tsv:52-56`. `docs/licensing.md:41-45` explains terms before distribution and distinguishes unrelated application source. `rust_automation/scaffold.rs:53-59`, `transform_text`, performs replacement without removing license headers; generator ownership is documented in `docs/rust-product-automation.md`, inventory scaffold row.\nTests: `tools/check-license-boundary.rs:196-197`, `run_self_tests`, accepts AGPL/rejects Apache template notice; `:149-158`, artifact/contains validators are applied to current template files. Archived `.cairn/archive/2026-08-30-adopt-unified-agpl-license/verification.md`, “License checks”, records a historical generated scaffold inspection; not a current run claim.\nLimit: terms of copied repository-owned source only, not automatic relicensing of unrelated downstream code.",
