      reason = "Accepted text: “Every future revision of repository-owned crates, tools, templates, fixtures, lifecycle material, and documentation MUST use `AGPL-3.0-or-later` unless an explicit path exception records another valid grant.”\nPolicy implementation: `docs/licensing.md:3-30`, “Repository-owned source” and exclusions; `Cargo.toml:30-34`, workspace license; `license-policy.tsv` enumerates package/text/template checks. `tools/check-license-boundary.rs:138-158`, metadata and text-marker validation, with stale-Apache/missing-text self-tests at `:179-245`.\nWhole-ID blocker: package-publication scenario requires complete license text inside produced source archives; current checker never opens archives, and an all-path authority/exception inventory is not present in the inspected policy. Current `Cargo.toml` has `chaoscontrol-guest-determinism-probe` and `chaoscontrol-wasm-exploration-core`; `license-policy.tsv` contains package rules for them but no crate-local LICENSE artifact rules. Existing package metadata and root policy are not proof of every distributed archive/path.",
